Description: Pre-generated source framework integration
Author: Daniel Richard G. <skunk@iSKUNK.ORG>

Modify various Python scripts used in the build to hook them into our
pre-generated source framework. This allows us to save a copy of source
files that require new-ish versions of nodejs/bindgen/etc. to generate,
and make use of them when building on older Debian releases that lack
the aforementioned versions of those tools.

Also part of the framework:

* debian/scripts/init-pre-gen.sh -- maintainer script to drive the
  generation of source files, and pack them into a new orig-pre-gen
  source tarball

* debian/deb_pre_gen.py -- main (Python) module, imported by the various
  scripts after the modifications seen below


